/*
 * Adapt GEOS document control/group behavior to opening web pages.
 *
 * URLDocumentControlClass configures the HTML file selector and close/open
 * commands. In builds that skip the startup New/Open prompt, it suppresses
 * that dialog. URLDocumentGroupClass intercepts a URL-load event and creates
 * an untitled document if none exists, then forwards the event. This lets
 * launch URLs and window commands share the normal document loading path.
 */

